{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfoldink</strong> is a <strong>2D logical puzzle adventure</strong> game where you <strong>craft unique combinations of cards</strong>, to come up with <strong>animated stories</strong> that explain the tribe's depararature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/BlowgunnerRunningToDeerRunningToBushCroped.gif?t=1743963584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UNFOLDINK OFFERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-&gt; <strong>Unique</strong> mind boggling\u00a0puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0-&gt; Total of <strong>10 diffrent cards</strong> and...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/AllCardsWithTextCropedScreenshot.png?t=1743963584\" /><strong>...over</strong> <strong>350 animated combinations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-&gt; Surprising and <strong>funny</strong> character <strong>interactions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/HunterCapybaraLakeCompressed.gif?t=1743963584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-&gt; Easy to understand gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-&gt; Between <strong>15 to 45 minute</strong> play through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/ArcherShootingDeerRunningToBush.gif?t=1743963584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ORIGINAL STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Ancient tribe in the Amazon rainforest left a trace of why they have left their camp base. Were they forced or did they want to leave ? Use the cards they left behind in <strong>various combinations</strong> to piece together the stories of <strong>what actually happened</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/DeerRUnningToTreeCapybaraRunningToLake.gif?t=1743963584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/extras/BlogunnerShootingSnakeAndHunterRunningToLake.gif?t=1743963584\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soon</strong> it will be\u00a0time to <i>UNFOLD</i>\u00a0the truth hidden within their strokes of <i>INK</i>.\u00a0<strong>Many</strong> people have tried\u00a0before, but\u00a0<strong>you\u00a0are the only one</strong> that can crack this <strong>mystery</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Until then, add this game to your <strong>wishlist</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252250?t=1743963584","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3252250?t=1743963584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/dcb79f124d70e42ba1c7933b35b3f9985981bc55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743963584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3252250/dcb79f124d70e42ba1c7933b35b3f9985981bc55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743963584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfoldink</strong> is a <strong>2D logical puzzle adventure</strong> game where you <strong>craft unique combinations of cards</strong>, to come up with <strong>animated stories</strong> that explain the tribe's depararature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor